      "content": "but it's not just \"carrying a lot.\" it feels deeper than that. like some part of my soul just snapped and won't ever go back. i look at people who get better or move on and i just feel... different. like i'm a version of a person that's just permanently damaged. it doesn't feel like a temporary phase.",
